{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17183","headline":"暮春闲居示同志 · 权德舆","name":"暮春闲居示同志","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"避諠非傲世，幽兴乐郊园。\n好古每开卷，居贫常闭门。\n曙钟来古寺，旭日上西轩。\n稍与清境会，蹔无尘事烦。\n静看云起灭，闲望鸟飞翻。\n乍问山僧偈，时听渔父言。\n体羸谙药性，事简见心源。\n冠带惊年长，诗书喜道存。\n小池泉脉凑，危栋燕雏喧。\n风入松阴静，花添竹影繁。\n灌园输井税，学稼奉晨昏。\n此外知何有，怡然向一罇。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"权德舆","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17183.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17183","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}